Package: miadi
Version: 0.1.1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: Miadi host environment
 Defines the MIADI_* environment of a Miadi host. /usr/share/miadi/env.sh
 holds the defaults and how each value is built; /etc/miadi/miadi.env holds
 this host's values as plain KEY=VALUE, readable by systemd and docker too.
